            { title = 'The server', note = '• MogHouse (moghouse.cc) is run by BNET.cc, which has served the FFXI community since nearly 2006 as part of eArena.net, with a publicly accessible private server for simple exploration.\n• Server address: --server ffxi.cc. Both Windower and Ashita are supported.\n• It runs LandSandBoat (the newest base branch when the image is built) with MogHouse\'s own modules; nothing is compiled on the server, it pulls a built image.\n• This is a fun / GM-sandbox server: per the GM Commands page, players are set up as GM level 1, and there is no active Auction House because of !additem.' },
