            { title = 'Server build', note = '• Image ghcr.io/tagban/moghouse-lsb:latest (image config "created" 2026-10-28; OCI label org.opencontainers.image.created 2026-10-25) is built on LandSandBoat commit 7df7474ffc (label cc.moghouse.lsb-commit) with MogHouse revision 1267f7f.\n• Rebuilt nightly when LandSandBoat or the repository changes; an image is published only if MogHouse\'s tests pass.' },
