    { name = 'Commands', group = 'Server', desc = 'Commands on MogHouse, levels read from the command code. Source: https://moghouse.cc/gm-commands/ https://github.com/tagban/moghouse-lsb/tree/1267f7f41a/modules/moghouse/commands', steps = {
            { title = 'Player commands (GM level 0: everyone)', note = '• !apocnigh: buy Ethereal, Hallow, Magnetic or Static Earring for 500,000 gil each.\n• Requires Zilart mission "Awakening" and Chains of Promathia "Dawn" completed, and nation rank 9 or higher.\n• !fixspeed: clears any movement-speed override, back to the server\'s regular speed.\n• !grats: plays the congratulations animation seen with fireworks.\n• !home: warps you to your Home Point.\n• !job: a shop of your current main job\'s Artifact (AF1) pieces plus a job neck/weapon item, 35,000-45,000 gil each.\n• Covers WAR through SCH; on GEO or RUN it refuses (the code calls those jobs broken).\n• !kill: a TRAP. It kills whoever types it and takes 20,000 EXP. Do not use it.\n• !shop <page>: the BNET.cc shop, anywhere in the world. !shop alone lists the pages.\n• Page 1: HQ elemental crystals, 3,000 gil each.\n• Page 2: food (Meat Jerky, Crab Sushi, Rice Dumpling, Blackened Frog) at Auction House prices.\n• Page 3: medicines and tools, e.g. Instant Reraise 15,000, Silent Oil / Prism Powder / Icarus Wing 5,000.\n• Page 4: misc gear, e.g. Chariot / Empress Band 15,000, Emperor Band 35,000, Key Ring Belt 32,000.\n• Page 5: ninja tools, 500 gil each.\n• Page 6: Corsair dice, 100 gil each.\n• Page 7: fireworks, 100 gil each.\n• Page 8: costume sets (Chocobo, Moogle, Novennial, Dinner, swimsuits, Dream), 10,000 gil each.\n• !starlight: holiday (Starlight) event shop: Dream +1 gear 30 gil a piece, plus a few event items. Opened to players for the event ("Modded 11/24").' },
            { title = 'GM level 1 commands', note = '• The GM Commands page (2022) says players are set up as GM level 1; if that still holds, these also work for players.\n• !aery: teleport to Dragon\'s Aery (Fafnir / Nidhogg).\n• !cerberus: teleport to Cerberus.\n• !chocobo: summons a chocobo to ride.\n• !dominion: teleport to Behemoth\'s Dominion (Behemoth / King Behemoth).\n• !down [n]: moves you down.\n• !flash: maximum movement speed.\n• !fly: fly; walls and the ground still stop you unless your own wallhack was on at take-off. Again: back down on the nearest floor. With the MogHouse launcher, Space rises and X sinks.\n• !flymount [name]: fly on a mount (chocobo by default, or e.g. hippogryph, tulfaire, levitus, fenrir; MogHouse-client-only bee, airship, boat, which other clients see as a retail mount).\n• !gmgear: gives GM gear.\n• !gmisland: sends you to a secret island.\n• !kirin: teleport to Kirin.\n• !learnmagic: learn all valid spells except Trusts.\n• !mobmp: a mob testing tool (targeted mob or by mob ID).\n• !seahorror: spawns several commonly requested NMs at once.\n• !signet: grants Signet for (your rank + your nation\'s rank + 3) hours.\n• !skyfx: a zone-wide look (aurora, wireframe, colour filter) that only MogHouse\'s own client draws; other clients see the zone as usual.\n• !slap <player> [damage]: knocks the target back; damage is optional and defaults to 0 (no damage).\n• !up [n]: moves you up.' },
